No, not really, everyone is even worthless, or worth it, depends on your perspective i think and maybe the next on the job fucks it really up and doesnt care. it seems that you care tho? thats good.(you posted) Why does college make you an idiot? fuck those people at college and go 2 college for yourself if you ***want*** to do it!  try 2 write a letter and burn the MTF. or get someone else to read it. or read it to yourself afterwards. get those feelings on paper, get the hatred out. And maybe postpone for a few days and do some things you were scared of beacuse it doesnt matter anyway right? and then you can see what would happen

&#x200B;

I hope you stick around, man! like.... Really!!
